# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for TaskSmack tests
#
# GoogleTest (v1.15) uses pthread_barrier internally for test-thread
# synchronisation.  SDL3 also spawns background threads during video
# initialisation.  The interaction between those threads and gtest's barrier
# code triggers false-positive data-race reports from TSAN on the
# pthread_barrier_destroy / pthread_barrier_wait entry points.
# These races are in third-party code, not in TaskSmack itself.
race:pthread_barrier_destroy
race:pthread_barrier_wait
